        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCBUR19ENTR, Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arc Tall Plate Entry Set with Burgundy Knob is stunning with its scalloped egg-shaped clear crystal knob and its traditional arched escutcheon plate. This Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is great for front doors. It features a single cylinder keyed function. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finish colors to offset the romantic allure of the Clear Burgundy Crystal Knob. The Arc Tall Plate Entrance Set with Burgundy Crystal Knob is 11 inches tall, so it will look fantastic on almost any door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/burgundy-crystal-knob-with-arc-plate-grandeur-arcbur19\"><b>Burgundy Knob with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Burgundy Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Burgundy Crystal Knob with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCBUR19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262396\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCBUR19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
